        { "host": "B", "text": "The Foundation says a researcher at the firm Calif reported an unconditional remote code execution on August 11th, and that OpenAI independently reported the same root cause the same day. Palo Alto Unit 42 says it found over 22.6 million exposed instances. Those are the companies' own numbers, not independently verified, and Unit 42 reports no confirmed exploitation against live systems." }
      ]
