        { "host": "A", "text": "What's the general lesson Amazon draws?" },
        { "host": "B", "text": "Amazon says AI-assisted analysis makes it cheaper to turn a patch diff or an advisory into a working exploit, so more actors can act within hours or even minutes once technical details are disclosed. Its advice is to measure patch timelines for internet-facing systems in hours." },
        { "host": "A", "text": "How much of that is confirmed?" },
