      "lines": [
        { "host": "A", "text": "It's Thursday, October 22nd, and this is The AI Edge, presented by Epilogue." },
        { "host": "B", "text": "Epilogue builds AI for work where being wrong is expensive, and ships systems that know what they know, show their work, and fail visibly instead of quietly. Find out more at epiloguelabs.com." },
        { "host": "A", "text": "I'm Maya." },
        { "host": "B", "text": "And I'm Alex." },
        { "host": "A", "text": "Here's what happened at the frontier of AI in the last 24 hours, with a source behind every claim." },
        { "host": "B", "text": "So what are the three that matter most today?" },
        { "host": "A", "text": "PHP shipped emergency patches for two unauthenticated remote code execution flaws, and Wiz Research says it found them using frontier AI models after the bugs had sat in the engine for over a decade." },
        { "host": "B", "text": "Microsoft attributes the ConnectWise supply chain compromise to a China-state-aligned group it calls Storm-0940, and says the group reached privileged access in under three hours." },
        { "host": "A", "text": "And Anthropic opened a research preview of Claude Duet, a proactive agent built on Claude Opus 5.5." }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "item",
      "section": "Frontier models & labs",
      "headline": "Anthropic opens a waitlisted research preview of Claude Duet, a proactive agent built on Claude Opus 5.5",
      "lines": [
        { "host": "A", "text": "Let's start with Duet. Alex, what is it?" },
        { "host": "B", "text": "Anthropic calls it a new app where Claude works as a proactive agent, designed around Claude Opus 5.5. It's by waitlist, starting with US Pro and Max subscribers, and 9to5Mac reports the rollout is US-only." },
        { "host": "A", "text": "What stops it doing something you didn't want?" },
        { "host": "B", "text": "Anthropic says Duet shows you what it plans to do and waits before it sends a message, makes a payment, signs a document or deletes anything. Trading securities and moving money between accounts are off-limits even with approval." },
        { "host": "A", "text": "Does Anthropic say where it falls short?" },
        { "host": "B", "text": "It does. Anthropic says Duet might misread a thread or miscalibrate what's urgent, and that it can't yet show you its browser. That's the company's own account, not independently verified, and Anthropic hasn't published a figure for how often Duet gets urgency wrong." }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "transition",
      "lines": [
        { "host": "A", "text": "To the research, where somebody measured what agents do once you hand them tools." }
      ]
    },
